      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>While moogle legends describe Moggle Mog as a kind, benevolent presence, the primal summoned by Mooglesguard is driven by the need to feast on ever-greater amounts of aether along with a large following to further solidify his being. - Moggle Mog</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 31, touch 19, flat-footed 25 (+1 size, +5 dex, +8 armor, +3 shield, +4 natural)</p><p>HP 188 [247] (13d10+117)</p><p>Fort +17, Ref +8, Will +9</p><p>Weakness Shadow</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft., fly 30 ft. (good)</p><p>Melee +1 Knight Sword +22/+17/+12 (1d8+8/19-20×2)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>STR 24, DEX 20, CON 28, INT 8, WIS 12, CHA 16</p><p>Base Atk +13; CMB +19; CMD +34</p><p>Feats Blundering Defense, Cautious Fighter, Covering Defense, Missile Shield, Shield Focus, Shield Ward, Uncanny Defense</p><p>Skills Fly +25</p><p>SQ Outsider traits, Does not Breathe, Does not Eat, Does not Sleep</p>"
